.SH NAME
blast-diff - Analyze the blast radius of changed files


.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBblast diff [] [flags]\fP


.SH DESCRIPTION
Compute impact for the set of JS/TS files changed between  and the
current working tree (including uncommitted changes). Default  is
HEAD, i.e. uncommitted changes only.


.SH OPTIONS
\fB--fail-on\fP=""
	exit with code 2 if any changed file's risk is at or above this level (low, medium, high)

.PP
\fB-h\fP, \fB--help\fP[=false]
	help for diff

.PP
\fB--json\fP[=false]
	output machine-readable JSON

.PP
\fB-o\fP, \fB--output\fP=""
	write the report to this file instead of stdout


.SH SEE ALSO
\fBblast(1)\fP


